{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b5ab-7adb-7e9c-9eef-563272601380","session_id":"01a1b5aa-c729-7df6-9d0b-469c0be45c4b","message":{"id":"01a1b5ab7adb7e9c9eef5630979c8cdf","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I confirm several things:\n- forecast is called in 3 places (line 94 filter, line 102 rank, line 116 picked). And rank comparator calls it multiple times per model (each comparison). So \"只算一次\" needs memoization. TB-7 claim (3) is correct: 3 call sites but comparator calls per model multiple times.\n- `cli` and `call` both output (line 123) — duplicate confirmed.\n- cursor-wsl: line 49 `cd '${cwd}'` inside bash -lc — injection risk confirmed.\n\nLet me read the rest.","signature":""}],"model":"hy4","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b5aac9ec784c83c68bb8ccbd74dc","_messageId":"01a1b5ab7adb7e9c9eef5630979c8cdf","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b5aac9ec784c83c68bb8ccbd74dc","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b5ab7adb7e9c9eef5630979c8cdf","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b5ab7adb7e9c9eef5630979c8cdf","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b5ab-7adb-7e9c-9eef-563272601380","traceparent":"00-17f4b9eb2faeae558c34db6876a0e1aa-f0f27ef812d96f38-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b5aa-c729-7df6-9d0b-469c0be45c4b,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b5aac9ec784c83c68bb8ccbd74dc"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:01:21.566Z"}
