call:{command:'C:/Program Files/nodejs/node.exe', args:['<pkg>/bin/cliworker.mjs','run','--lease','l_7d1e','--config','C:/Users/u/.cliworker/config.json'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', output:'cliworker.event/v1', timeout_ms:1800000}}\n  11→约束：calls[i] 与 models[i].call 完全相同；默认视图不含 provider/cli/vendor/模型 id/价格/额度/forecast/直接命令。view:'full'（仅管理 CLI 与 UI）额外给 detail:{model_key:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', cli:'claude', vendor:'anthropic', funding:'plan', pools:[], forecast:{}, direct_call:{command:'claude', args:['-p','--model','claude-sonnet-5-5','--output-format','stream-json','--verbose','--permission-mode','plan'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', env_names:['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']}}。compat:'draft' 或无 schema 的旧请求返回 0.1 扁平形状（key/provider/id/prices/quota/forecast/call，去掉重复 cli）并带 deprecation:{removed_in:'0.3.0'}。\n  12→\n  13→【4 Event v1（run 的 stdout JSONL）】{schema:'cliworker.event/v1', seq:1, lease_id:'l_7d1e', type:'start', at:'2026-11-07T10:00:01Z'}；文本：{type:'text', text:'...'}；用量：{type:'usage', input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300}；结束：{type:'result', ok:true, exit_code:0, text:'...', usage:{input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300}}；错误：{type:'error', code:'E_PROVIDER_QUOTA', retryable:false, message:'...'}。\n  14→\n  15→【5 错误码与 CLI 退出码（稳定注册表）】0 成功（含 truncated）；1 E_INTERNAL；2 E_REQUEST_INVALID, E_LEVEL_REQUIRED, E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, E_SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, E_UNSAFE_ARG；3 E_CONFIG, E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE, E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE, E_SECRET_BACKEND；4 E_STATE_LOCKED, E_TIMEOUT（retryable）；5 E_NO_CANDIDATE, E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA；6 E_LEASE_UNKNOWN, E_LEASE_EXPIRED, E_LEASE_CONSUMED；7 E_PROVIDER_AUTH, E_PROVIDER_QUOTA, E_PROVIDER_FAILED。错误体统一为 {ok:false, error:{code:'E_CONFIG', message:'...', retryable:false, retry_after:null}}。警告码：W_FIELD_IGNORED, W_FIELD_DEPRECATED, W_CONFIG_V1, W_STALE_DATA。兼容的选模拒选原因 E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION 只出现在 draft 视图里。\n  16→\n  17→【6 cliworker.model/v1（管理视图，只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.model/v1', key:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', id:'claude-sonnet-5-5', cli:'claude', pro